<title>POLAND: Warsaw bourse order balancing-session delayed.</title>
<headline>Warsaw bourse order balancing-session delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse's order-balancing session will start with a 20-minute delay at around 0950 GMT, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
